{"version":1,"content":"<p>樂隊RubberBand《沐光公園》音樂會2026將於12月5 日在西九文化區安盛竹翠公園舉行，票價分為$980﹑$780及$580。</p><p>RubberBand將第11張專輯命名為《Komorebi》，「Komorebi」來自日本的專有詞彙「木漏れ日」，用來形容陽光穿過樹葉的光影。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-20T12:04:06.137912+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":139,"images":0,"source":"明報 娛樂","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-20T06:19:58+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-20T18:57:48.205478+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-20T11:57:40.684322+00:00","content_hash":"6d46e7ba5a22b32cd1226e21a70e9d028024af94b1b8cefa64d89a48dbe7f32c","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}